Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mdbook
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: command line tool to create books with Markdown
 mdBook is a command line tool and Rust crate to create books using
 Markdown (as by the CommonMark specification) files. It is similar to
 Gitbook but written in Rust, producing a static HTML site with search,
 syntax highlighting, and live-reload serving for local preview.
